{"id":"222","t":"Numerical Methods","s":"m","v":1,"a":222,"z":234,"sheets":[["img/222-g0.webp",849,3705]],"st":[[111,"Differences of a polynomial","h = step size, a<sub>n</sub> = leading coefficient","Degree-n polynomial: Δ<sup>n</sup>y = constant = a<sub>n</sub>·n!·h<sup>n</sup>; Δ<sup>n+1</sup>y = 0",1489,1526],[112,"Numerical differentiation","h = step","Newton forward at x₀: dy/dx = (1/h)[Δy₀ − Δ²y₀/2 + Δ³y₀/3 − …]; d²y/dx² = (1/h²)[Δ²y₀ − Δ³y₀ + (11/12)Δ⁴y₀ − …]",1489,1526],[113,"Bisection method","","x = (a + b)/2 where f(a)·f(b) &lt; 0",1489,1526],[114,"Newton–Raphson","","x<sub>n+1</sub> = x<sub>n</sub> − f(x<sub>n</sub>)/f′(x<sub>n</sub>)",1489,1526],[115,"Regula falsi","","x = [a f(b) − b f(a)]/[f(b) − f(a)]",1489,1526],[116,"Linear systems","","Gauss elimination → upper triangular + back-substitution; Gauss–Jordan → diagonal (identity)",1489,1526],[117,"Finite difference operators","E = shift operator","Δy<sub>0</sub> = y<sub>1</sub> − y<sub>0</sub>; ∇y<sub>1</sub> = y<sub>1</sub> − y<sub>0</sub>; E = 1 + Δ; ∇ = 1 − E<sup>−1</sup>",1489,1526],[118,"Newton forward interpolation","p = (x − x<sub>0</sub>)/h, h = spacing","y = y<sub>0</sub> + pΔy<sub>0</sub> + p(p−1)Δ²y<sub>0</sub>/2! + …",1489,1526],[119,"Newton backward interpolation","p = (x − x<sub>n</sub>)/h","y = y<sub>n</sub> + p∇y<sub>n</sub> + p(p+1)∇²y<sub>n</sub>/2! + …",1489,1526],[120,"Lagrange interpolation","","y = Σ y<sub>i</sub> Π<sub>j≠i</sub> (x − x<sub>j</sub>)/(x<sub>i</sub> − x<sub>j</sub>)",1489,1526],[121,"Trapezoidal rule","h = interval width","∫y dx = (h/2)[y<sub>0</sub> + y<sub>n</sub> + 2(y<sub>1</sub> + … + y<sub>n−1</sub>)]",1489,1526],[122,"Simpson&#x27;s 1/3 rule","n must be even","∫y dx = (h/3)[y<sub>0</sub> + y<sub>n</sub> + 4(odd ordinates) + 2(even ordinates)]",1489,1526],[123,"Simpson&#x27;s 3/8 rule","n multiple of 3","∫y dx = (3h/8)[y<sub>0</sub> + y<sub>n</sub> + 3(y<sub>1</sub> + y<sub>2</sub> + y<sub>4</sub> + …) + 2(y<sub>3</sub> + y<sub>6</sub> + …)]",1489,1526],[124,"Euler&#x27;s method","dy/dx = f(x, y)","y<sub>n+1</sub> = y<sub>n</sub> + h f(x<sub>n</sub>, y<sub>n</sub>)",1489,1526],[125,"Runge–Kutta 4th order","k<sub>1</sub> = hf(x,y); k<sub>2</sub> = hf(x+h/2, y+k<sub>1</sub>/2); k<sub>3</sub> = hf(x+h/2, y+k<sub>2</sub>/2); k<sub>4</sub> = hf(x+h, y+k<sub>3</sub>)","y<sub>1</sub> = y<sub>0</sub> + (k<sub>1</sub> + 2k<sub>2</sub> + 2k<sub>3</sub> + k<sub>4</sub>)/6",1489,1526],[126,"Error &amp; stability of iterations","","Bisection: n ≥ log₂[(b − a)/ε] iterations; forward Euler on y′ = λy: y_{k+1} = (1 + hλ)y_k, stable only if |1 + hλ| &lt; 1 (real λ = −1/τ ⇒ h &lt; 2τ; pure-imaginary λ ⇒ always unstable)",1489,1526]],"az":[["Bisection method","x = <span class=\"fr\"><span>a + b</span><span>2</span></span> where f(a) ⋅ f(b) &lt; 0",1567],["Differences of a polynomial","Degree −n polynomial : Δ<sup>n</sup>y = constant = a<sub>n</sub> ⋅ n! ⋅ h<sup>n</sup><br>Δ<sup>n + 1</sup>y = 0",1569],["Error &amp; stability of iterations","Bisection : n ≥log<sub>2</sub> [<span class=\"fr\"><span>b − a</span><span>ε</span></span>] iterations<br>forward Euler on y<sup>′</sup> = λy : y<sub>k + 1</sub> = (1 + hλ)y<sub>k</sub>, stable<br>only if |1 + hλ| &lt; 1<br>real λ = −1 ⇒ h &lt; 2τ; pure −imaginary λ ⇒always unstable<br>( τ )",1570],["Euler stability &amp; Newton for systems","y<sup>′</sup> = −<span class=\"fr\"><span>y</span><span>τ</span></span> by Euler : y(k + 1) = (1 − <span class=\"fr\"><span>h</span><span>τ</span></span>) y(k) →stable<br>iff |1 − <span class=\"fr\"><span>h</span><span>τ</span></span>| &lt; 1 ⇒ h &lt; 2τ<br>Newton–Raphson for f(x) = 0 (vector) : x(k + 1) = x(k) − J<sup>−1</sup> f(x(k))",1570],["Euler&#x27;s method","y<sub>n + 1</sub> = y<sub>n</sub> + h f(x<sub>n</sub>, y<sub>n</sub>)",1570],["Finite difference operators","Δy<sub>0</sub> = y<sub>1</sub> − y<sub>0</sub><br>∇y<sub>1</sub> = y<sub>1</sub> − y<sub>0</sub><br>E = 1 + Δ<br>∇= 1 − E<sup>−1</sup>",1570],["Lagrange interpolation","y = Σ y<sub>i</sub> Π<sub>j ≠i</sub> <span class=\"fr\"><span>x − x<sub>j</sub></span><span>x<sub>i</sub> − x<sub>j</sub></span></span>",1573],["Least-squares straight line","y = mx + c : m = <span class=\"fr\"><span>nΣxy −ΣxΣy</span><span>nΣx<sup>2</sup> −(Σx)<sup>2</sup></span></span>, c =̄ y − m̄ x",1573],["Linear systems","Gauss elimination → upper triangular + back-substitution<br>Gauss–Jordan → diagonal (identity)",1574],["Newton backward interpolation","y = y<sub>n</sub> + p∇y<sub>n</sub> + <span class=\"fr\"><span>p(p + 1)∇<sup>2</sup>y<sub>n</sub></span><span>2!</span></span> + …",1575],["Newton forward interpolation","y = y<sub>0</sub> + pΔy<sub>0</sub> + <span class=\"fr\"><span>p(p −1)Δ<sup>2</sup>y<sub>0</sub></span><span>2!</span></span> + …",1575],["Newton–Raphson","xn + 1 = xn − <span class=\"fr\"><span>f(x<sub>n</sub>)</span><span>f<sup>′</sup>(x<sub>n</sub>)</span></span>",1575],["Numerical differentiation","Newton forward at x<sub>0</sub> : <span class=\"fr\"><span>dy</span><span>dx</span></span> = (<span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>h</span></span>)[Δy<sub>0</sub> −Δ<span class=\"fr\"><span>y<sub>0</sub></span><span>2</span></span><sup>2</sup> + <span class=\"fr\"><span>Δ<sup>3</sup>y<sub>0</sub></span><span>3</span></span> −…]<br><span class=\"fr\"><span>d<sup>2</sup>y</span><span>dx<sup>2</sup></span></span> = (<span class=\"fr\"><span>1</span><span>h<sup>2</sup></span></span>)[Δ<sup>2</sup>y<sub>0</sub> −Δ<sup>3</sup>y<sub>0</sub> + (<span class=\"fr\"><span>11</span><span>12</span></span>)Δ<sup>4</sup>y<sub>0</sub> −…]",1575],["Regula falsi","x = <span class=\"fr\"><span>[a f(b) − b f(a)]</span><span>[f(b) − f(a)]</span></span>",1578],["Runge–Kutta 4th order","y1 = y0 + <span class=\"fr\"><span>k<sub>1</sub> + 2k<sub>2</sub> + 2k<sub>3</sub> + k<sub>4</sub></span><span>6</span></span>",1578],["Simpson&#x27;s 1/3 rule","∫ y dx = (<span class=\"fr\"><span>h</span><span>3</span></span>)[y<sub>0</sub> + y<sub>n</sub> + 4(odd ordinates) + 2(even ordinates)]",1579],[